      "id": "aec100e4-d001-44ea-801a-45ff9745a1dc",
      "name": "Version Changes",
      "description": {
        "content": "Each **Experience's Variation** has one or more **Changes**; a change represent the actual modification that\nis applied to a visitor. It can be a piece of javascript or CSS code for web experiences or it can be a string value for example\nin case of a fullstack experience.\n",
        "type": "text/plain"
      },
      "item": [
